@startuml
title Alarm Clock State Machine

[*] --> OffState

state "Off" as OffState
state "Alarm Activated" as AlarmActivated
state "Ringing" as Ringing

OffState : entry/Initialize system
OffState : do/Wait for alarm setting or shutdown
OffState : exit/Shut down system

AlarmActivated : entry/Set alarm time
AlarmActivated : do/Activate alarm if current time matches set time
AlarmActivated : exit/Ringing

Ringing : entry/Ring the alarm
Ringing : do/Ring until stopped by user
Ringing : exit/Stop ringing and return to Alarm Activated state

OffState --> AlarmActivated : [alarm set]
AlarmActivated --> Ringing : [current time matches set time]
Ringing --> OffState : [alarm stopped]

@enduml
